Subject: Welcome to UTMFW 7.9!

This release showcases the new ICAP architecture, using SSLproxy with Icap 
mode of operation, icapsuricata, c-icap, Suricata, and E2Guardian as ICAP 
server.

Highlights of this release are:
- SSLproxy 0.10.0
- icapsuricata 0.1.0
- Suricata 8.0.7
- c-icap 0.6.5
- E2Guardian 5.5.9
- OpenSSL 3.5.7
- libevent 2.1.13
- nghttp2 1.69.0
- nghttp3 1.18.0
- ngtcp2 1.25.0

